            <title>[IGNITE-8044] IgniteQueryGenerator.getOptions() method should properly handle empty list of parameters.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8044</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteQueryGenerator.getOptions()&lt;/tt&gt; method does not check that the parameters list can be empty.&lt;/p&gt;

